; Late base merge. R is processed first and decides R:2 @ F without the
; pending G:2 @ R profile. G later rejects G:2 @ R (cold). The final merge
; must move G:2 @ R into the R base and its child G:2 @ R:2 @ F into the
; already inlined R:2 @ F context, so no samples are dropped or counted twice.

; RUN: llvm-profgen --format=text --llvm-sample-profile=%S/Inputs/cs-preinline-scc-late-base.prof --binary=%S/Inputs/cs-preinline-scc-nested.perfbin --output=%t -debug-only=cs-preinliner 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=DECISION
; RUN: FileCheck %s --input-file %t

; REQUIRES: asserts

; DECISION: Process _Z1Rm
; DECISION-NEXT:   Inlined context profile for: _Z1Rm:2 @ _Z1Fm (callee size: 56, call count:5000000)
; DECISION: Process _Z1Gm
; DECISION-NEXT:   Outlined context profile for: _Z1Gm:2 @ _Z1Rm (callee size: 36, call count:50)

; CHECK:      {{^}}_Z1Rm:10000090:5000050
; CHECK-NEXT:  1: 5000050
; CHECK-NEXT:  2: _Z1Fm:5000040
; CHECK-NEXT:   1: 5000040
; CHECK-NEXT:   !CFGChecksum: 281528181014178
; CHECK-NEXT:   !Attributes: 2
; CHECK:      {{^}}_Z1Gm:2000000:1000000
; CHECK-NEXT:  1: 1000000
; CHECK-NEXT:  2: 50 _Z1Rm:50
